	"data": "Concept: Cycles App (Biological Rhythm Tracker)\n\nWhat It Is\nA recurring personal project idea: an app to track biological cycles, energy patterns, and rhythms over time. Appears across multiple ChatGPT eras without ever graduating to a repo. High personal utility, low priority in the face of bigger projects.\n\nThe name \"Cycles\" appears to be the working title, though the exact scope shifts — sometimes it's about sleep/energy cycles, sometimes about broader personal rhythms.\n\nCore Vision\nTrack…",
